#### `src/power/power_sensor.fl` - 예상 350줄

전력 측정의 핵심 데이터 수집 모듈입니다. Phase 8의 `calculateEnergyPerOperation()` 수식과 `CPUMetrics.thermal_level` 필드를 직접 가져옵니다.

**핵심 구조체 및 열거형:**

```
struct PowerReading {
    timestamp_us: u64,
    battery_voltage_mv: u32,       // 단위: mV (3000-4200)
    current_ma: i32,               // 단위: mA (음수=충전, 양수=방전)
    temperature_celsius: f64,      // Phase 7 thermal_level → 실제 온도로 변환
    cpu_frequency_mhz: u32,        // 현재 주파수
    power_consumption_mw: f64,     // 전력 소모 (mW) = voltage × |current| / 1000
    thermal_ratio: f64,            // Phase 7 CPUMetrics.thermal_level 그대로 (0.0-1.0)
}

impl PowerReading {
    fn new(voltage_mv: u32, current_ma: i32, temp: f64) -> PowerReading
    fn power_consumption_mw(&self) -> f64    // = voltage_mv × |current_ma| / 1_000_000
    fn is_critical_drain(&self) -> bool      // current_ma > 500 (과소비)
    fn is_charging(&self) -> bool            // current_ma < 0
    fn thermal_ratio_from_temp(&self) -> f64 // temp / max_temp (Phase 7 스타일)
}

struct BatteryState {
    capacity_mah: u32,             // 총 용량 (예: 1200mAh)
    remaining_mah: u32,            // 남은 용량
    level_percent: f64,            // 0.0-1.0
    estimated_life_minutes: u32,   // 잔여 수명
    charge_cycles: u32,            // 충방전 사이클 수
    health_ratio: f64,             // 배터리 건강도 (0.0-1.0)
}

impl BatteryState {
    fn new(capacity_mah: u32) -> BatteryState
    fn update_from_reading(&mut self, reading: &PowerReading, elapsed_sec: f64)
    fn is_low(&self) -> bool         // level < 20%
    fn is_critical(&self) -> bool    // level < 5%
    fn drain_rate_mah_per_hour(&self) -> f64
}

struct PowerSensor {
    readings: Vec<PowerReading>,    // 최근 N개 (순환 버퍼)
    battery: BatteryState,
    max_readings: u32,              // 기본 100개
    baseline_mw: f64,               // Linux 기준 250mW
}

impl PowerSensor {
    fn new(capacity_mah: u32, baseline_mw: f64) -> PowerSensor
    fn sample(&mut self, reading: PowerReading)
    fn average_consumption_mw(&self) -> f64
    fn calculate_mw_per_cycle(&self, freq_mhz: u32) -> f64
        // Phase 8 calculateEnergyPerOperation() 수식:
        // energy = power_mw / (freq_mhz × 1_000_000) × 1_000_000_000 (pJ)
    fn savings_vs_baseline(&self) -> f64    // (baseline - current) / baseline
    fn thermal_throttle_factor(&self) -> f64
        // Phase 8 controlThermalThrottling() 그대로:
        // temp > max → 0.5, temp > max-10 → 0.8, else → 1.0
}
```

**재사용:** `calculateEnergyPerOperation()` 수식 (Phase 8 cpu-optimizer.fl L860-870), `controlThermalThrottling()` 로직 (L878-887), `CPUMetrics.thermal_level` 필드 개념

